#X text 560 1010 sec5.2 verify_request authorization ladder (authenticated EXECUTE = operation not hello/authenticate). Rungs (each a visible guard failing to its sec5.2a code): authz_decode -> integrity (403 capability_denied) -> reqsig (401 authentication_failed) -> cap_present (403) -> grantee (match? -> capchain : grantee_resolvable) -> grantee_resolvable (unresolvable -> 401 unresolvable_grantee the single carve-out : resolvable-mismatch -> 403) -> capchain (403) -> validity (403). The ALLOW path (post-validity) proceeds to the sec6.6 walk + check_permission + dispatch (501 placeholder until the real handler lands). Bytes CBOR crypto live in [ecodec] - the sequence is authored here.;
