#X text 560 1300 sec6.6 tree-walk (ALLOW path): walk_nsegs then longest-prefix loop (walk_prefix i then tree_get then type==system/handler? found : i--) then i<1 -> 404 not_found. On found the matched pattern -> authz_check_perm (sec5.2 step 5) -> perm_ok? dispatch(501 placeholder) : 403 capability_denied.;
