#X msg 250 55 net_listen 15104;
#X text 430 55 sec6.11 transport: ecodec owns the TCP listener (per-connection buffer + frame assembler + issued-nonce + reply-targeting + admission cap). stock netreceive broadcasts replies and has no per-conn id (A-PD-002). loadbang bangs net_listen. a complete frame is decoded and dispatched on the canvas below. the reply targets the originating connection.;
#X text 30 1145 (frame-assembler objects above are superseded by the ecodec per-connection transport - inert pending removal.);
#X text 560 1170 §6.5 op-existence gate (between §6.6 resolution and §5.2 perm): a registered handler that does NOT implement the requested operation MUST return 501 unsupported_operation REGARDLESS of authority (§6.2). op_supported \$1 (the resolved pattern) -> op_ok? 0 -> 501 : 1 -> authz_check_perm (reads the stashed pattern). So 501 (op absent) is decided before 403 (perm denied).;
