#X text 860 505 RT-6 (sec4.6) anti-replay: a SECOND authenticate on an already-established connection must be REJECTED, not re-processed (it would re-verify the still-cached nonce and re-issue a grant). auth_check_established runs before auth_decode; established_ok 0 -> 401 invalid_nonce (obj 35, the same rung a bad nonce-echo uses) WITHOUT touching auth_decode/nonce/sig/bind; established_ok 1 -> the normal PoP ladder proceeds unchanged.;
